; Accepted deviation: a pad serves the assertions on its own account only. Beancount
; also lets the assertion on the sub-account use up the pad of its parent, which then
; pads nothing for the parent's own assertion: the pad is unused, and the parent's
; assertion fails. Zhang pads the parent by 40, and both assertions hold.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:Bank
1970-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open
1970-01-01 open Income:X

2024-01-02 * "x" "salary"
  Assets:Bank:Checking  60 CNY
  Income:X

2024-01-03 pad Assets:Bank Equity:Open
2024-01-04 balance Assets:Bank:Checking  60 CNY
2024-01-05 balance Assets:Bank  100 CNY
